          <p><em><strong>Siena: The Art of Bronze, 1450=E2=80=931500</stron=
g></em><br>October 15, 2026 to January 18, 2027</p><p><em>Siena: The Art of=
 Bronze, 1450=E2=80=931500</em> is the first exhibition to focus on Siena a=
s a center of artistic excellence and technical innovation in bronze sculpt=
ure during the Italian Renaissance. Bringing together some forty works=E2=
=80=94many of which have never been exhibited outside of Tuscany=E2=80=94th=
e exhibition invites visitors to appreciate the medium=E2=80=99s beauty and=
 versatility while learning about the complex technical and political chall=
enges that the Sienese bronzeworkers faced.</p><p><a class=3D"frickbutton m=
